    "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a gross prior year reserve release of GBP 77.022 million in 2017. This was primarily driven by positive claims development and robust reserves for the 2015 year of account. However, the 2016 year of account experienced adverse development, requiring reserve strengthening due to a high incidence of natural catastrophe losses, including Hurricane Matthew and the impact of Hurricanes Harvey, Irma, and Maria, as well as greater than expected loss frequency. The overall movement was a net release, despite mixed performance across different prior underwriting years, and also included an exchange loss.",
